                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "if you like rally games BUT you arent a fan of unoptimized unreal engine slop and you dont take videogames too seriously , then for 1 buck on sale ( or less! ) this game is absolutely for you . the progression is very well done ; you can buy , repair , and tune your cars however you want after earning moneys through championships ( or hacking in moneys with \"Cheats.AddCash(99999)\" command in console (~) ) . another cool feature is the limb damage you get when you crash into things , so when you crash too much your driver gets injured and you have to start over ! this makes driving feel a lot more exciting buuuut if you dont like that then thankfully you can always back up your save folder ( = profile ) or even modify the code to your liking , as [b]this game comes with its source code inside JavaSrc when purchased ![/b]\n\ni think this game is a very refreshing and fun entry to the rally videogame world , with clearly a lot of love put into it . 10/10\n\np.s. the in-game analog and digital input support worked for me",
